ract logic from Magento - what is the logic on product attributes / what transformation is needed on the product attributes coming from AP21? Also waiting on documentation on the diagram / flow in MuleSoft for the integration AP21 to NewStore - since this one is already running through MuleSoft - we may be able to reuse part of this flow |\n| 14 | `colourFilter` and `materialFilter` mapping mechanism — confirm how Magento currently handles the mapping from raw colour/fabric values to filter groups, and whether the same approach (e.g. custom object + BM job) should be replicated in SFCC | Zimmermann Merch / Dev Lead | Open | Pending confirmation of Magento approach before mapping mechanism story can be scoped. |",
